  "notes": "{実行|じっこう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ is used as a する-verb meaning \"to execute\" or \"to carry out.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {実行|じっこう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to execute, to carry out)\n- {実行|じっこう}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{移|うつ}す→移す：10122_utsusu⟧ (to put into action)\n- {実行|じっこう}⟦{力|りょく}→力：noentry⟧ (ability to act, executive ability)\n- {実行|じっこう}⟦{委員|いいん}{会|かい}→委員会：12234_iinkai⟧ (executive committee)\n- {実行|じっこう}⟦{中|ちゅう}→〜中：09840_chuu⟧ (in progress, executing)\n\nCOMPUTING:\nIn computer science, {実行|じっこう} means \"to run\" or \"execute\" a program.",
